# Internal packages allowed to stay unreachable from every binary.
#
# Each entry needs a reason. This list is for optional storage adapters that a
# deployment composes outside the serving binary, not for feature modules: a
# feature that no binary uses belongs in the tree only after it is wired.
#
# diagnostics/postgres is a metadata-only PostgreSQL adapter. The serving
# composition persists diagnostic envelopes in the local durable queue
# (diagnostics.queue_dir); remote metadata needs an integration.Runtime
# persistence hook that does not exist yet.
github.com/LaokeQwQ/CheeseWAF/internal/diagnostics/postgres
